# Exceptions: small, aggregate (non-patient-level) project outputs that
# are safe and useful to track -- evaluation metric summaries and the
# Phase 3 hyperedge co-occurrence statistics (aggregate variable-pair
# stats, not raw patient records).
!Agentic-Metacognitive-MDT_V1-August2026/evaluation/reports/*.json
!Agentic-Metacognitive-MDT_V1-August2026/hypergraph/*.json

